      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents in Jackson Heights praise the salon for neat haircuts, soft coats, and thorough deshedding treatments. Dogs and cats return home looking adorable and smelling pleasant, with several clients highlighting the signature blueberry facial. One reviewer noted that styling choices for cats were mostly limited to lion cuts."
      }
