        "en": "Warm and courteous grooming professionals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The team at Dalila's is commended for welcoming customer service, punctuality, and clear consultation before grooming. Stylists listen carefully to owner preferences and make helpful suggestions regarding coat maintenance. Reviewers appreciate the respectful and unhurried interactions from the front desk to the styling tables."
      }
    },
