      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle approach with sensitive pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients highlight how comfortable their anxious dogs and cautious cats remain during baths and grooming sessions. Attendants handle animals with calm reassurance, minimizing anxiety during nail trims and ear cleaning. This gentle treatment encourages many pet owners to return regularly for routine grooming."
      }
    }
